  "about": {
    "title": "About Me",
    "subtitle": "Software Developer at Plusgrade",
    "profileImage": "/app/_assets/images/profile.jpg",
    "mainContent": "I'm a software developer in Montreal with over five years of experience building web products. I work on the Optimizations team at Plusgrade, where my day-to-day spans React, Go, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, and data tools like PostHog, Snowflake and Splunk.\n\nBefore Plusgrade, I spent three years at Sheertex building e-commerce features end to end: customer accounts, a store locator, a wishlist with email notifications, and a migration from React to Remix that cut initial page load times by 40%. I also reviewed code and managed an external developer. I started at Manhattan International, building checkout, upsell and shipping integrations.\n\nOutside work I build side projects. The most recent, Pillie, is an iOS app live on the App Store.\n\nWrite to idriss@idrisskone.com.",
    "additionalContent": "Idriss Kone is a software developer at Plusgrade.",
